<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · song</p><h1 class="enc-title">Jai Jai Garavi Gujarat</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1873">1873</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a> · Also known as જય જય ગરવી ગુજરાત, Jay Jay Garavi Gujarat</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">&quot;Jai Jai Garavi <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gujarat">Gujarat</a>&quot; is a poem written in 1873 by the Gujarati poet Narmadashankar Dave, known as Narmad, who is considered the first modern Gujarati writer. He wrote it as the foreword to his first Gujarati dictionary, the Narmakosh.</p></div>
